6/avav-20260430x10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are a defense technology provider delivering integrated capabilities across air, land, sea, space, and cyber. We develop and deploy autonomous systems, precision strike systems, counter-UAS technologies, space-based platforms, directed energy systems, and cyber and electronic warfare capabilities. We operate an international manufacturing footprint, delivering proven systems and capabilities in markets that we believe offer the potential for significant long-term growth. In addition, we believe that some of the innovative potential products, services and technologies in our R&D pipeline will emerge as new growth platforms in the future, creating additional market opportunities. Effective May 1, 2025 in connection with our acquisition of BlueHalo Financing Topco, LLC (\"BlueHalo\"), we operate our business in two reportable segments: (1) Autonomous Systems (\"AxS\") and (2) Space, Cyber an","zh":"我們是一家國防技術供應商，提供跨空中、陸地、海上、太空和網路的綜合能力。我們開發和部署自主系統、精確打擊系統、反無人機技術、天基平台、定向能係統以及網路和電子戰能力。我們的製造足跡遍及全球，在市場上提供經過驗證的系統和能力，我們相信這些系統和能力具有顯著的長期成長潛力。此外，我們相信我們研發管線中的一些具有創新潛力的產品、服務和技術將成為未來新的成長平台，創造更多的市場機會。自 2025 年 5 月 1 日起，隨著我們收購 BlueHalo Financing Topco, LLC（「BlueHalo」），我們在兩個可報告部門中運營我們的業務：(1) 自主系統（「AxS」）和 (2) 太空、網路和"},{"en":"Uncrewed Aircraft Systems (\"UAS\"). Our family of uncrewed systems includes Group 1-3 UAS which are deployed globally and offer multi-mission capability, autonomy, versatility, reliability and ease of use, providing the warfighter with critical situational awareness.","zh":"無人駕駛飛機系統（“UAS”）。我們的無人系統系列包括 1-3 組 UAS，這些無人機在全球部署，具有多任務能力、自主性、多功能性、可靠性和易用性，為作戰人員提供關鍵態勢感知能力。"},{"en":"Small UAS (\"SUAS\"): Small UAS in Groups 1 and 2 are designed for reliable operation at low altitudes, offering real-time observation and communication capabilities with easy transport, assembly, and quiet electric propulsion. Products include Puma LE, Puma 3 AE, Puma VTOL, P550, Raven B, and VAPOR 55 CLE. Systems within the SUAS portfolio utilize our common and interoperable handheld ground control systems and an array of spare parts and accessories.","zh":"小型無人機系統（「SUAS」）：第 1 組和第 2 組中的小型無人機系統專為低空可靠運作而設計，提供即時觀測和通訊功能，且易於運輸、組裝和安靜的電力推進。產品包括 Puma LE、Puma 3 AE、Puma VTOL、P550、Raven B 和 VAPOR 55 CLE。 SUAS 產品組合中的系統利用我們通用且可互通的手持式地面控制系統以及一系列備用零件和配件。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We sell the majority of our products and services to the U.S. DoD, serving branches such as the U.S. Army, Marine Corps, Special Operations Command, Air Force, Navy, Space Force, and Cyber Command; the intelligence community agencies; federal and public safety agencies; allied governments and coalition partners through direct commercial sales or foreign military sales; and commercial customers, supporting critical infrastructure protection, open-source intelligence operations, and advanced research initiatives.","zh":"我們的大部分產品和服務銷往美國國防部，為美國陸軍、海軍陸戰隊、特種作戰司令部、空軍、海軍、太空部隊和網路司令部等分支機構提供服務；情報界機構；聯邦和公共安全機構；透過直接商業銷售或對外軍事銷售的盟國政府和聯盟夥伴；和商業客戶，支援關鍵基礎設施保護、開源情報運營和高級研究計劃。"},{"en":"During our fiscal year ended April 30, 2026, we generated approximately 25% of our revenue from the U.S. Army pursuant to orders placed under contract by the U.S. Army on behalf of itself as well as for several other organizations within the U.S. DoD. For that same period, other U.S. government agencies and government subcontractors accounted for 47% of our sales revenue. However, no individual contract accounted for greater than 10% of funded backlog as of April 30, 2026.","zh":"在截至 2026 年 4 月 30 日的財年中，我們約 25% 的收入來自美國陸軍，這是根據美國陸軍代表其自身以及美國國防部內的其他幾個組織根據合約下的訂單而產生的。同期，其他美國政府機構和政府分包商占我們銷售收入的 47%。然而，截至 2026 年 4 月 30 日，沒有單一合約佔已融資積壓資金的 10% 以上。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We believe the principal competitive factors in the markets for our products and services include product performance; safety; innovative features; acquisition cost; lifetime operating cost, including maintenance and support; ease of use; rapid integration with existing equipment and processes; quality; reliability; customer support; and brand reputation. Several companies across the globe, primarily in the U.S., attempt to compete in our markets to some degree, although we believe none match the breadth and depth of our product lines nor our expertise in core capabilities.","zh":"我們相信我們的產品和服務在市場上的主要競爭因素包括產品性能；安全;創新功能；購置成本；生命週期營運成本，包括維護和支援；易於使用；與現有設備和製程快速整合；品質;可靠性;客戶支援；和品牌聲譽。全球有幾家公司（主要是美國公司）試圖在某種程度上參與我們的市場競爭，儘管我們相信沒有一家公司能與我們產品線的廣度和深度以及我們在核心能力方面的專業知識相匹配。"},{"en":"The defense market for UAS continues to evolve in response to changing technologies, shifting customer needs and expectations and the potential introduction of new products. Our current principal competitors include Elbit Systems Ltd., Quantum-Systems, Inc., Redwire Corporation, Teledyne Technologies, Inc., Sierra Nevada Corporation, Lockheed Martin Corporation, The Boeing Company, Textron, Inc., Shield AI, Inc., Northrop Grumman Corporation, Griffon Aerospace, Inc., L3Harris Technologies, Inc., Anduril Industries, Inc., Airbus SE and Israeli Aircraft Industries.","zh":"無人機系統的國防市場不斷發展，以應對不斷變化的技術、不斷變化的客戶需求和期望以及潛在的新產品推出。我們目前的主要競爭對手包括Elbit Systems Ltd.、Quantum-Systems, Inc.、Redwire Corporation、Teledyne Technologies, Inc.、Sierra Nevada Corporation、Lockheed Martin Corporation、波音公司、Textron, Inc.、Shield AI, Inc.、Northrop Grumman Corporation、Griffon Aerospace, Inc.、L3Harris Technologies Inc.、AndHarris Technologies"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-04-30","items":[{"name":"Autonomous Systems","val":1358077000,"zh":"自主系統部門"},{"name":"Space Cyber & Directed Energy","val":618768000,"zh":"空間網路與定向能源部門"}],"total":1976845000},"prod":{"end":"2026-04-30","items":[{"name":"Precision Strike & Defense Systems","val":848342000,"zh":"精確打擊與防禦系統"},{"name":"Service","val":561496000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Uncrewed Aircraft Systems","val":363878000,"zh":"無人駕駛飛機系統"},{"name":"Cyber & Mission Solutions","val":345364000,"zh":"網路與任務解決方案"},{"name":"Space & Directed Energy","val":273404000,"zh":"Space & Directed Energy"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":145857000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"}],"total":1976845000},"geo":{"end":"2026-04-30","items":[{"name":"Geographic Distribution Domestic","val":1420437000,"zh":"Geographic Distribution Domestic"},{"name":"Geographic Distribution International","val":556408000,"zh":"Geographic Distribution International"}],"total":1976845000}},"peers":["KTOS","RCAT","ONDS","LHX","VRT"]}}